`k063: the painted demand for the friend's debt` MEANS `The threat made to me` WITH
    `what it threatened, expressly or as it may reasonably be regarded` IS `to cause a person a detriment of any kind`
    `the threatened thing would be unlawful` IS TRUE
    `it was meant to gain a benefit for someone` IS TRUE
    `it was meant to cause someone a detriment` IS FALSE
    `it was meant to stop me doing something I am entitled to do` IS FALSE
    `it was meant to make me do something I am entitled not to do` IS TRUE
    `the circumstances` IS `the lender's people at Jake's door, nobody else home`

`k063: the painted demand, with Ruby at home` MEANS `The threat made to me` WITH
    `what it threatened, expressly or as it may reasonably be regarded` IS `to cause a person a detriment of any kind`
    `the threatened thing would be unlawful` IS TRUE
    `it was meant to gain a benefit for someone` IS TRUE
    `it was meant to cause someone a detriment` IS FALSE
    `it was meant to stop me doing something I am entitled to do` IS FALSE
    `it was meant to make me do something I am entitled not to do` IS TRUE
    `the circumstances` IS `the same, with Ruby (3) at home`

`k063: the painted demand, a death threat` MEANS `The threat made to me` WITH
    `what it threatened, expressly or as it may reasonably be regarded` IS `to kill a person`
